{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54241","headline":"六合怀古诗 [苻]（符）融城 · 郏滂","name":"六合怀古诗 [苻]（符）融城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦人百万征南日，蕞（《光绪志》作「蓦」）地[苻]（符）筑此城。\n把隘亡兵今有几，莲峰之下误争名。\n（〖1〗《嘉靖志》注：「《嘉定志》。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郏滂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}